            "review_text": "Quynh M\n622 contributions\n0\nGood spot for board game\nJan 2025 • Friends\nCYA Board Game Cafe is a great spot for spending quality time with friends. \nThey offer a wide variety of board games, ensuring there’s something for everyone. Whether you’re an experienced player or a beginner, the staff is incredibly helpful and will explain the rules to make sure you understand how to play. \nIt’s an excellent place to relax and have fun while killing time with friends. I've been here twice and still want to come back\nHighly recommended for board game enthusiasts!\nRead more\nWritten January 8, 2025",
